graph LR
    GW[vllm-orchestrator-gateway]

    %% Runtime libraries
    GW -->|HTTP server, SSE| Axum[axum 0.7.9]
    GW -->|async runtime| Tokio[tokio 1.41.1]
    GW -->|orchestrator client| Reqwest[reqwest 0.12.12]
    Reqwest -->|TLS backend| NativeTLS[native-tls 0.2.12]
    GW -->|PEM to PKCS12| OpenSSL[openssl 0.10.73<br/>system OpenSSL]
    GW -->|YAML config| SerdeYml[serde_yml 0.0.12]
    GW -->|logging, DEBUG fixed| Tracing[tracing 0.1.41]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    GW -->|"REST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection"| Orchestrator[FMS Guardrails Orchestrator]
    Orchestrator -.->|detector names must match| Detectors[guardrails-detectors /<br/>regex detector]
    Orchestrator -.->|generation| VLLM[vLLM model server]
    GW -.->|CA bundle, inferred| ServiceCA[OpenShift service-ca]

    %% Consumers / deployers
    TrustyOp["trustyai-service-operator<br/>(historical)"] -.->|deployed gateway| GW
    RHODS["rhods-operator<br/>(ODH image only)"] -.->|image reference| GW
    Proxy["Fronting auth proxy<br/>(deployer-provided)"] -->|"HTTP/8090"| GW

    style GW fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px
    style Axum fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Tokio fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Reqwest fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style NativeTLS fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style OpenSSL fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style SerdeYml fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Tracing fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Orchestrator fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Detectors fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style VLLM fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style ServiceCA fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style TrustyOp fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style RHODS fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Proxy fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
